    "evidence": "Strong cyber-forensic art direction, disciplined cyan/red semantics, and a clear headline-to-proof hierarchy across all viewports. However, desktop has excessive empty space above the hero and an awkwardly detached results annotation; tablet/mobile become very tall, dense stacks with cramped proof typography; and the mobile header visibly truncates navigation (“LIVE WI”) while the desktop header’s oversized ghost wordmark competes with the nav. These issues keep it below polished demo-ready quality.",
